  "text": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
    "text": "<p>For the 13th year, Stryker has received the prestigious Gallup Exceptional Workplace Award. This award recognizes organizations for their extraordinary ability to create engaged workplace cultures that drive business outcomes.</p>\n<p>This year, Gallup honored 38 organizations from across the globe, representing a range of different industries. Gallup reviewed employee responses to their annual employee engagement survey (Q12) and each company’s response rate when determining the list. In addition, a panel of Gallup workplace experts evaluated applicants and assessed them based on criteria established by a comprehensive workplace study.</p>\n<p>To learn more about Gallup, check out their <a href=\"https://www.gallup.com/workplace/290909/2020-gallup-exceptional-workplace-award-recipients.aspx\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #4c7d7a;\">website</span></a>.</p>\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Mar 18 2020 17:20:03 GMT+0000",
    "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
    "textIsRich": "true"
  },
